Nope, there is no guaranteed way to cure stunning in one turn (evil
grin). After eating a lizard corpse (fully consuming that is, one bite
is not enough as with stoning), the timeout is reduced to two turns;
obviously, that's fairly worthless :p

Prayer cannot cure confusion either, but it can cure blindness.

Don't use an eucalyptus leaf if you have another way out: if it is
rotten you'll die.

> I tried teleporting him away and gave up after about three
> tries, but later got it to work in wiz mode. A ?oEarth might
> save you here. A ?oSM might as well.

Teleporting only works if you get the free turn.

Earth is very good if Demogorgon is not next to you at the moment.
Otherwise you would have to 'F'-direction until you hit Demogorgon and
he teleports away, so you will need some healing potions.

Dropping a scroll of scare monster is excellent if you have one.

Another (rather greedy) option is to wish for a rubber chicken. You'll
need (real-life) luck to hit him and you'll also need a fair amount of
sickness cures.

Note that wishing while stunned works normally.

